a:2:{s:6:"result";a:20:{i:0;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:242101;s:5:"title";s:5:"Cacau";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nNCFBKZ68fmr008moWSzLdu2mUP.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3xVmBU66Ukp79BBKAbHMySSAqq3.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:167:"Cacau is an engaging saga of family secrets, clandestine loves and sacrifices, all sweetened by the irresistible taste of chocolate and the magic of cocoa plantations.";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2024-01-15";s:10:"popularity";d:2477.49899999999979627318680286407470703125;s:12:"vote_average";d:5.5;s:10:"vote_count";i:8;}i:1;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:94722;s:5:"title";s:10:"Tagesschau";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7dFZJ2ZJJdcmkp05B9NWlqTJ5tq.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jWXrQstj7p3Wl5MfYWY6IHqRpDb.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:82:"German daily news program, the oldest still existing program on German television.";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"1952-12-26";s:10:"popularity";d:2237.0749999999998181010596454143524169921875;s:12:"vote_average";d:6.79999999999999982236431605997495353221893310546875;s:10:"vote_count";i:202;}i:2;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:222289;s:5:"title";s:28:"Fam&iacute;lia &eacute; Tudo";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tDbJuSfVhf3ZnxiJrXlXEALyAz5.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hpZ5VJP1MvQjuFUMORuAoDFAH30.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:616:"Five half-siblings &ndash; Venus, Andromeda, Jupiter, Electra, and Plutao &ndash; share the same father, Pedro. Separated by their respective mothers after Pedro's death, the quintet have had few social and intimate interactions since. Years later, now adults, they reunite when their millionaire grandmother disappears on a cruise and is presumed dead. To earn their inheritance, they will have to live and work together for a year in an attempt to bring the family business back to its peak. If they don't succeed, the inheritance will go to their cousin, Hans, who will do anything to get the money from his aunt.";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2024-03-04";s:10:"popularity";d:1981.857999999999947249307297170162200927734375;s:12:"vote_average";d:6.0709999999999997299937604111619293689727783203125;s:10:"vote_count";i:7;}i:3;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:223365;s:5:"title";s:7:"Rebirth";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kUWvvMkNIf21UUDmHjYw55v6o7C.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bEKRyT7WN5TjFKv0JTWI2cyNlak.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:957:"After making a pact with Jequitib&aacute;, Jos&eacute; Inoc&ecirc;ncio becomes a mythical figure, known as the most successful cocoa farmer in the region. While still young, he wins the heart of Maria Santa. Their intense passion results in four children: Jos&eacute; Augusto, Jos&eacute; Bento, Jos&eacute; Ven&acirc;ncio, and the youngest, Jo&atilde;o Pedro, who never had the opportunity to know his mother, as she dies while giving birth to him. This tragedy fuels Jos&eacute; Inoc&ecirc;ncio&rsquo;s anger, blaming Jo&atilde;o Pedro for the loss of his great love. Throughout their lives, indifference and resentment mark the relationship between the father and his youngest son. As if the past weren&rsquo;t enough, years later, the arrival of the mysterious Mariana puts all these emotions to the test when both father and son fall in love with the same woman. This situation reawakens feelings that were either dormant or previously unknown to them.";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2024-01-22";s:10:"popularity";d:1998.62300000000004729372449219226837158203125;s:12:"vote_average";d:7.28099999999999969446662362315692007541656494140625;s:10:"vote_count";i:16;}i:4;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:122653;s:5:"title";s:8:"Gutfeld!";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9zLuN3MfvTcABYYNJq5PkIG81S5.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bPnzBs4Ka1tZFCsZF3cPkzNjiLC.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:88:"Greg Gutfeld examines the news of the day through a satiric lens fused with pop culture.";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2021-04-05";s:10:"popularity";d:1755.13599999999996725819073617458343505859375;s:12:"vote_average";d:6;s:10:"vote_count";i:4;}i:5;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:99611;s:5:"title";s:34:"The Henry Ford's Innovation Nation";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7YDU977mxN8Z67RT5CfSa8mpZgk.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:30:"/assets/images/no-backdrop.png";s:8:"overview";s:931:"The Henry Ford&rsquo;s Innovation Nation is a weekly Saturday morning show on CBS that showcases present-day change-makers from all over the world who are creating solutions to real needs. It is hosted by news correspondent and CBS Sunday Morning regular Mo Rocca. Each episode presents stories related to the process of innovation and also includes one story on The Henry Ford&mdash;its Archive of American Innovation, its unique visitor experiences and its unparalleled expertise. The intent is to stimulate curiosity and to inspire audiences with entertaining yet educational stories about yesterday and today&rsquo;s visionaries and turning points that changed the course of history, as well as innovations and inventions that are changing the world today. The Henry Ford&rsquo;s Innovation Nation is produced in partnership by The Henry Ford and Litton Entertainment, a leading independent production and distribution company.";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2014-09-27";s:10:"popularity";d:2176.50199999999995270627550780773162841796875;s:12:"vote_average";d:0;s:10:"vote_count";i:0;}i:6;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:257762;s:5:"title";s:17:"Land Key Immortal";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6U3zOASUqAffUh9eShy9Xag3aSz.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3kwUyrGtzMa2hSb2dlf6tNO6xSp.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:0:"";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2024-06-24";s:10:"popularity";d:1424.451999999999998181010596454143524169921875;s:12:"vote_average";d:0;s:10:"vote_count";i:0;}i:7;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:90521;s:5:"title";s:11:"Love Island";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kU2y21cls8WargMaX7KI47URMjD.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/m0TiLZ79RR19Zz0AZruQSBeH39x.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:310:"American version of the British dating reality competition in which ten singles come to stay in a villa for a few weeks and have to couple up with one another. Over the course of those weeks, they face the public vote and might be eliminated from the show. Other islanders join and try to break up the couples.";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2019-07-09";s:10:"popularity";d:1405.80400000000008731149137020111083984375;s:12:"vote_average";d:7.0999999999999996447286321199499070644378662109375;s:10:"vote_count";i:140;}i:8;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:213220;s:5:"title";s:20:"Urban Horror: Taipei";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vG7cmUDBvNQDa2pX3yRQSxmprab.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sxjPXtxN3R9h0jAvHFclzHcTXnd.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:415:"Do you often feel inexplicably disturbed in this cold, unconcerned city? Those things we are used to but not specifically noticed are not caused by supernatural or spiritual phenomena, but the daily, under-the-surface crises sparked by the fear, ignorance and indifference around us. This is a series without ghosts, monsters, supernatural or sci-fi components. Every story in Urban Horror is happening around us...";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2024-07-12";s:10:"popularity";d:1375.232999999999947249307297170162200927734375;s:12:"vote_average";d:0;s:10:"vote_count";i:0;}i:9;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:82670;s:5:"title";s:13:"World War Two";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wAs1ai9mVvebPK2Fz46oKjipeTt.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dfWbyhujRsX6B0AcQE0f3QtUhxk.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:88:"Follow the deadliest conflict in human history in real time, week by week, blow by blow.";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2018-09-01";s:10:"popularity";d:1335.988000000000056388671509921550750732421875;s:12:"vote_average";d:8;s:10:"vote_count";i:3;}i:10;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:20812;s:5:"title";s:24:"Val&oacute; Vil&aacute;g";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kQ6EfC1igZRNSSsnQbLG2mrOLwj.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:30:"/assets/images/no-backdrop.png";s:8:"overview";s:0:"";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2002-09-09";s:10:"popularity";d:829.3609999999999899955582804977893829345703125;s:12:"vote_average";d:3.100000000000000088817841970012523233890533447265625;s:10:"vote_count";i:9;}i:11;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:79855;s:5:"title";s:26:"Questions pour un champion";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tKb3dm32wUDQmWNfygbvTkYKobb.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n9u72dPMB1e3IpgN3LHRaons6gw.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:127:"Samuel Etienne hosts this emblematic game, which sees four candidates compete each evening around questions of general culture.";s:12:"release_date";s:0:"";s:10:"popularity";d:480.13600000000002410160959698259830474853515625;s:12:"vote_average";d:4.29999999999999982236431605997495353221893310546875;s:10:"vote_count";i:6;}i:12;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:130780;s:5:"title";s:13:"Bigg Boss OTT";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8ANsjzsyuVwvVBuC0jm8ZNQ06Jw.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wRczLejEF54LNAPhTXStqrQM1Db.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:282:"Sass aur Sazish, Drama aur Romance... itna over the top ke TV pe ban ho jayega! Karan Johar flags off the first-ever, the digital-only season of Bigg Boss with the bigg promise of gossip, controversies & uncensored drama. And let's just say... he's going to take it ALL #OverTheTop!";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2021-08-08";s:10:"popularity";d:872.087999999999965439201332628726959228515625;s:12:"vote_average";d:6.35700000000000020605739337042905390262603759765625;s:10:"vote_count";i:14;}i:13;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:46195;s:5:"title";s:10:"Monogatari";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zCEjjb1NH3LLsWeZx47wOeqkezf.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2WBO3C7CjsOTT5wgi9Inn5iQhVv.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:393:"Although there are still traces of the brief period he became a vampire, third-year high school student Koyomi Araragi is human again. He happens upon others with their own supernatural problems and finds that he can empathize. Koyomi becomes involved in their lives, seeking to help them and occasionally asking for advice from Meme Oshino, the homeless man who helped him become human again.";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2009-07-03";s:10:"popularity";d:724.615999999999985448084771633148193359375;s:12:"vote_average";d:8.132999999999999118927007657475769519805908203125;s:10:"vote_count";i:446;}i:14;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:126398;s:5:"title";s:10:"Wonderland";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yT4C02yo5MsPLB3damor8YncRvW.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/69UPsr6cdPzegykPjJWyNI2SWuc.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:368:"A social experiment reality show about the cultivation of an ideal community, inviting 15 guests to Taohuawu, 15KM away from the city center, to live together for 21 days, creating an ideal society in their hearts. See how they live, work, and live in harmony in friction and cooperation. It is also a journey to explore the source of material and spiritual consensus.";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2021-05-23";s:10:"popularity";d:405.3809999999999718056642450392246246337890625;s:12:"vote_average";d:8.199999999999999289457264239899814128875732421875;s:10:"vote_count";i:4;}i:15;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:153297;s:5:"title";s:32:"The Magical Chef of Ice and Fire";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oPdLohDiDINvjPIrlM3qc0W16sk.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t69MCVZgQp903zlbHvsOJxnNBsl.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:677:"Nian Bing is the son of a fire mage and an ice mage. After both of his parents were killed by the Ice Lord, Nian Bing received both of his parents' magic gems. When Nian Bing was trying to escape from the Ice Lord's followers, he managed to cast both fire and ice magic at the same time. An impossible feat for a mage. He fell from the cliff, unconscious, and was saved by an oldman. After he woke up, the oldman gave him a food so delicious he never tasted before. It turned out that the oldman was a genius chef, once called a spirit chef. And he wants Nian Bing to be his disciple no matter what! Is Nian Bing able to seek vengeance while aiming to become the greatest chef?";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2021-12-11";s:10:"popularity";d:392.4940000000000281943357549607753753662109375;s:12:"vote_average";d:6;s:10:"vote_count";i:5;}i:16;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:86882;s:5:"title";s:26:"Love & Marriage Huntsville";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rM0Y0sN3c6dMYbTvPq9KLcAc2TK.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gkIqlGCSSBfg1fJarvsuA7qvS5g.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:197:"Follow the lives of three high-powered African-American couples who come together to revitalize the thriving city of Huntsville, Alabama through their joint real estate venture, The Comeback Group.";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2019-01-12";s:10:"popularity";d:534.865999999999985448084771633148193359375;s:12:"vote_average";d:9.5999999999999996447286321199499070644378662109375;s:10:"vote_count";i:5;}i:17;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:70672;s:5:"title";s:16:"Men on a Mission";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2jIi55JtYKJTL1km8qHMuUilOWo.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mZsTrylVWYYPkoY793G5G7nBbAa.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:146:"Male celebs play make-believe as high schoolers, welcoming star transfer students every week and engaging in battles of witty humor and slapstick.";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2015-12-05";s:10:"popularity";d:526.0249999999999772626324556767940521240234375;s:12:"vote_average";d:7.5;s:10:"vote_count";i:31;}i:18;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:154770;s:5:"title";s:14:"Hello Saturday";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.