The program showcases the talent of various stars as well as social topics through creative and diverse content and games. It aims to spread positive energy whilst keeping up with the current trends and leading youth culture.";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2022-01-01";s:10:"popularity";d:523.1580000000000154614099301397800445556640625;s:12:"vote_average";d:4.5;s:10:"vote_count";i:2;}i:19;a:9:{s:2:"id";i:91121;s:5:"title";s:16:"How Do You Play?";s:11:"poster_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dJd8LFodX9831AeRD3CzWklYcS5.jpg";s:13:"backdrop_path";s:63:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dgutaqpLcLMoJInkbglyG8cLuji.jpg";s:8:"overview";s:265:"Yoo Jae-suk reunites the producing team of Infinite Challenge and presents you How Do You Play? The Indefinitely expanding YOONIVERSE, based on Yoo's blood, sweat, and tears, will entertain viewers at home. Let's follow Yoo and his friends' new projects every week.";s:12:"release_date";s:10:"2019-07-27";s:10:"popularity";d:477.8170000000000072759576141834259033203125;s:12:"vote_average";d:8.266999999999999459987520822323858737945556640625;s:10:"vote_count";i:15;}}s:13:"total_results";a:1:{i:0;i:160;}}